  "range_versus_rows_derivation": "Four synthetic daily rows (1, 2, 5 and 6 March 2026 with units 10, 20, 50, 60), no partition. ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW sums the current row and the two rows before it: 10; 10+20 = 30; 10+20+50 = 80; 20+50+60 = 130. RANGE BETWEEN INTERVAL 2 DAYS PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW sums the rows whose day lies within two days before the current day: 1 Mar -> {1} = 10; 2 Mar -> {1, 2} = 30; 5 Mar -> {3, 4, 5} holds only 5 Mar = 50 (3 and 4 March have no row; 1 and 2 March are outside); 6 Mar -> {4, 5, 6} = 50+60 = 110.",
